Homepage: https://cybermind.fr/secubox
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: secubox-kiosk
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         bash,
         systemd,
         secubox-premier-pas
Recommends: secubox-console
Description: SecuBox GUI kiosk — installation and setup tool
 Provides secubox-kiosk-setup, which installs a minimal GUI (X11 or
 Wayland) with Chromium fullscreen on the SecuBox WebUI, creates the
 dedicated secubox-kiosk user and the systemd unit, and switches a box
 between kiosk, console TUI and plain console.
 .
 The unit it generates starts /usr/sbin/secubox-kiosk-launcher, shipped by
 secubox-premier-pas.
 .
 Usage: secubox-kiosk-setup install --x11 && secubox-kiosk-setup enable --x11
 .
 Port Debian de SecuBox-DEB (CyberMind.fr).
